# Source PDFs are build inputs, not repo content. This repo is PUBLIC, and
# 09_Sample_Sources/ holds in-copyright books (commercial translations, art
# monographs) used to build sample cartridges. Keep them local; commit the
# spec and the audit, not the source text. Already-tracked files are NOT
# affected by this rule — untracking those is a separate, deliberate decision.
09_Sample_Sources/*.pdf
09_Sample_Sources/**/*.pdf
